WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.700
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:02.702
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.702 --> 00:00:03.836
We hope you're
doing well tonight

00:00:03.836 --> 00:00:05.037
and now, we're going
to get to the news.

00:00:05.037 --> 00:00:07.407
Vice President Kamala Harris
spoke yesterday

00:00:07.407 --> 00:00:11.010
at a gala for a pro-abortion
rights organization and said,

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:13.145
"Those Republican leaders

00:00:13.145 --> 00:00:16.249
who are trying to weaponize the
use of the law against women,

00:00:16.249 --> 00:00:18.584
well, we say, how dare they."

00:00:18.584 --> 00:00:20.220
Great.
That oughta do it.

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:21.620
[ Laughter ]

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:23.990
And, if that doesn't stop them,
you can always throw in

00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:25.424
a "Harumph?!"

00:00:25.424 --> 00:00:28.094
[ Laughter ]
Microsoft co-founder Bill Gates

00:00:28.094 --> 00:00:30.796
spoke out yesterday
against the potential reversal

00:00:30.796 --> 00:00:33.833
of the Supreme Court's decision
in Roe v Wade

00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:36.769
and warned that it would
"set us back 50 years."

00:00:36.769 --> 00:00:39.505
He said the next time America
makes that much progress,

00:00:39.505 --> 00:00:41.507
we should remember to hit save.

00:00:41.507 --> 00:00:43.409
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:43.409 --> 00:00:45.578
In a new interview,
Maryland Governor Larry Hogan

00:00:45.578 --> 00:00:48.214
said that former President Trump
should not run for reelection

00:00:48.214 --> 00:00:51.517
and added that Trump is
"enjoying playing golf

00:00:51.517 --> 00:00:52.952
five or six day as week."

00:00:52.952 --> 00:00:54.120
Why ruin that

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:56.388
by going back to a job
where he could only play

00:00:56.388 --> 00:00:58.158
four or five days a week?

00:00:58.158 --> 00:01:02.962
[ Laughter, cheering,
and applause ]

00:01:02.962 --> 00:01:06.299
President Biden is set to hold
a Cinco de Mayo party tomorrow

00:01:06.299 --> 00:01:08.368
at the White House,
because what's more fun

00:01:08.368 --> 00:01:10.069
than a Cinco de Mayo
party thrown

00:01:10.069 --> 00:01:11.704
by someone who doesn't drink?

00:01:11.704 --> 00:01:14.106
[ Laughter and applause ]
That's like having
a Halloween party

00:01:14.106 --> 00:01:16.776
and saying, "But FYI,
this is a no-sugar house.

00:01:16.776 --> 00:01:18.143
Who loves raisins?!"

00:01:18.143 --> 00:01:19.546
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:19.546 --> 00:01:21.080
NASA is planning on sending

00:01:21.080 --> 00:01:23.282
naked images of humans
into space

00:01:23.282 --> 00:01:24.484
as part of a new mission

00:01:24.484 --> 00:01:26.318
to communicate
with alien civilizations.

00:01:26.318 --> 00:01:28.688
Guys, you can't do that.

00:01:28.688 --> 00:01:31.557
At the very least,
you have to hit them

00:01:31.557 --> 00:01:33.525
with a "U up?" first.

00:01:33.525 --> 00:01:34.827
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:34.827 --> 00:01:37.263
And, finally,
the NFL announced today

00:01:37.263 --> 00:01:39.398
that the New York Giants
will play a game

00:01:39.398 --> 00:01:41.935
against the Green Bay Packers
this season in London.

00:01:41.935 --> 00:01:44.504
So, instead of losing
27 to nothing,

00:01:44.504 --> 00:01:46.905
the Giants will lose 27-nil.

00:01:46.905 --> 00:01:48.207
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:48.207 --> 00:01:49.442
And that was a monologue,
everybody!

